7
00:00:28,243 --> 00:00:34,247
Four issuer schemas. One central plan. A deterministic guard.

8
00:00:34,247 --> 00:00:42,251
Synthetic functional demo — fixture planner. No Meta model invocation in this capture; eligible live evaluation pending account prerequisites.

9
