Known plan: adultOver18 on synth-1, guard accepted. Review shows exactly what is shared.

11
00:00:53,779 --> 00:00:58,782
Known baseline accepted — decision and plan receipt recorded.

12
00:01:00,621 --> 00:01:05,624
Now the unfamiliar schema: Fjord. The page never names its wire field up front.

13
00:01:06,156 --> 00:01:11,159
Fjord consent: who asks, what they learn, expiry — controls in view.

14
00:01:12,861 --> 00:01:18,864
Provenance is the exact backend answer: FIXTURE mode, mapped policy, guard verdict.

15
00:01:19,266 --> 00:01:26,269
Returned plan discovers claim "isAdult" on synth-2 — issuance routes there.

16
00:01:26,674 --> 00:01:31,676
Deterministic guard accepted under sovra-guard/2 before anything was minted.

17
00:01:32,079 --> 00:01:36,086
Holder reviews exact claims, issuer, plan hash — then decides.

18
00:01:36,920 --> 00:01:42,923
Fjord accepted: real ACCEPTED receipt with decision and plan identifiers.

19
00:01:43,718 --> 00:01:48,722
Second alias: Harbor discovers a different wire field for the same outcome.

20
00:01:49,289 --> 00:01:56,291
Harbor plan carries "qualifiesAsAdult" from the returned plan only — no echo.

21
00:01:56,752 --> 00:02:02,756
Harbor accepted on its own issuer node — two stores, one outcome each.

22
00:02:03,550 --> 00:02:07,553
Incompatible schema: employment tenure cannot prove age.

23
00:02:08,737 --> 00:02:15,741
Grounded NO_PATH with null plan: no credential, no consent, nothing shared.

24
00:02:16,689 --> 00:02:20,692
Decline is honored: no presentation exists for a declined request.

25
00:02:21,276 --> 00:02:27,278
Back and Cancel before a decision also share nothing; a committed decision cannot be cancelled.

26
00:02:27,278 --> 00:02:34,281
Synthetic fixtures only; live AI is off. Backend verify: 860 tests passed.

27
00:02:34,533 --> 00:02:41,033
Fjord and Harbor map to the requested age-over-18 result.

28
00:02:41,033 --> 00:02:47,533
Employment returns NO_PATH: no plan, credential, or consent.

29
00:02:47,533 --> 00:02:53,733
Synthetic fixtures. Fixture planner. Live AI is off.

30
